					<description><![CDATA[I have been told my a few Indigenous people that are local to my region that the &quot;window-dressing&quot; compassion that I have tried to bring forward can (most effectively) be made authentic by my embrace of learning the Abeneki language. This is a next step for me.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I have been told my a few Indigenous people that are local to my region that the &#8220;window-dressing&#8221; compassion that I have tried to bring forward can (most effectively) be made authentic by my embrace of learning the Abeneki language. This is a next step for me.</p>
